ADGofTest upstream license notice
=================================

The upstream ADGofTest 0.3 DESCRIPTION file declares:

    License: GPL

No GPL version is selected in the package metadata and the source files do not
contain a more specific license header. This translation preserves that exact
license declaration rather than asserting a version that the upstream package
does not state.

Copies of GPL version 2 and GPL version 3 are provided in licenses/ for
reference. The complete upstream source and original archive are retained in
upstream/.
